        {
          "text": " ndyabataataanisiza omu mahanga agu bo na baishenkurubo batakamanyaga, mbakuratse rurara, okuhitsya obu ndibamaraho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.16",
